    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a B2B lead qualification assistant. Evaluate how sales-ready this lead is based on the data below.\n\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nPhone: {{ $json.phone }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}\n\nScoring guidance:\n- Consider clarity and specificity of intent in their message (e.g. asking about pricing, enterprise plans, or a demo signals higher intent than a vague inquiry)\n- Consider company context if provided (named company vs. blank, business email domain vs. generic)\n- Consider completeness of the submission\n- score 80-100 = hot (clear buying intent, strong fit signals)\n- score 50-79 = warm (interested but needs nurturing)\n- score 0-49 = cold (low intent or insufficient info)\n\nReturn your evaluation.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
